    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the battlefield of Dfiance \u2014 a free-to-play tactical card game where cunning strategy, timing, and sharp decision-making determine your path to victory. Designed for players who crave fast-paced, competitive card duels with a twist, Dfiance brings you into a fantasy world where every match is a mind game. Build your army, craft your deck, and lead your forces into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/c6eb92ae26e1bbc3bc5a43afc66152b0.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FAIR GAME FOR TRUE COMPETITORS</strong><br>Dfiance is free to play and always will be. With no pay-to-win mechanics, progress comes from your skill and smart deck-building. Win cards, unlock new tactics, and rise through the ranks based on merit alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VISUALLY DISTINCT, STRATEGICALLY DEEP</strong><br>Every unit, spell, and battlefield is brought to life with unique animations and effects. Whether you\u2019re spectating or clashing head-on, the world of Dfiance keeps you immersed with each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/9f0dd43a242426d3ee87597f7d194c31.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=1600 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIN WITH BRAINS, NOT LUCK</strong><br>Victory in Dfiance isn\u2019t random. Outsmart your opponents in a duel of wits across a dynamic battlefield. Control the tempo, predict your rival\u2019s moves, and dominate with your strategy \u2014 not your wallet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/984d35ceb9dccd2426e1cdd7ad71f9f3.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=1600 height=842 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MODES. ONE GOAL: DOMINATE</strong><br>From ranked PvP battles and weekend tournaments to themed challenges and custom lobbies, there\u2019s always a new way to test your deck and prove your dominance. With our new <strong>Spectate Mode</strong>, you can even watch the top players live and learn from their every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT ACROSS THE FRONTLINES</strong><br>Engage your cards across unique lanes \u2014 manage the formation, time your combos, and deploy key units when the moment is right. With every decision carrying weight, no battle feels the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU SET THE STRATEGY. YOU LEAD THE CHARGE.</strong><br>Will you pressure early or play the long game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Only the best tacticians rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/88f08ff5e8c4eac4906ac5590030e8ff.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=1600 height=842 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the battlefield of Dfiance \u2014 a free-to-play tactical card game where cunning strategy, timing, and sharp decision-making determine your path to victory. Designed for players who crave fast-paced, competitive card duels with a twist, Dfiance brings you into a fantasy world where every match is a mind game. Build your army, craft your deck, and lead your forces into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/c6eb92ae26e1bbc3bc5a43afc66152b0.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FAIR GAME FOR TRUE COMPETITORS</strong><br>Dfiance is free to play and always will be. With no pay-to-win mechanics, progress comes from your skill and smart deck-building. Win cards, unlock new tactics, and rise through the ranks based on merit alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VISUALLY DISTINCT, STRATEGICALLY DEEP</strong><br>Every unit, spell, and battlefield is brought to life with unique animations and effects. Whether you\u2019re spectating or clashing head-on, the world of Dfiance keeps you immersed with each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/9f0dd43a242426d3ee87597f7d194c31.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=1600 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIN WITH BRAINS, NOT LUCK</strong><br>Victory in Dfiance isn\u2019t random. Outsmart your opponents in a duel of wits across a dynamic battlefield. Control the tempo, predict your rival\u2019s moves, and dominate with your strategy \u2014 not your wallet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/984d35ceb9dccd2426e1cdd7ad71f9f3.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=1600 height=842 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MODES. ONE GOAL: DOMINATE</strong><br>From ranked PvP battles and weekend tournaments to themed challenges and custom lobbies, there\u2019s always a new way to test your deck and prove your dominance. With our new <strong>Spectate Mode</strong>, you can even watch the top players live and learn from their every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT ACROSS THE FRONTLINES</strong><br>Engage your cards across unique lanes \u2014 manage the formation, time your combos, and deploy key units when the moment is right. With every decision carrying weight, no battle feels the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU SET THE STRATEGY. YOU LEAD THE CHARGE.</strong><br>Will you pressure early or play the long game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Only the best tacticians rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672650/extras/88f08ff5e8c4eac4906ac5590030e8ff.avif?t=1755525718\" data-has-big width=1600 height=842 /></span></p>",
